re six Vedangas"'::jsonb, '"Language sciences/Sanskrit and astronomy/Vedanga Jyotish"'::jsonb, '"Vastu and textile dyeing only"'::jsonb, '"Purusharthas and hardware ports"'::jsonb, '"Itihasa and spreadsheet formulas"'::jsonb, '"Design suitability depends on local conditions; compare storage, supply and maintenance evidence"'::jsonb, '"One system must be superior everywhere"'::jsonb, '"The syllabus gives no permission to discuss water systems"'::jsonb, '"Only their names matter"'::jsonb, '"They are the Purusharthas, or goals of human life, not architecture tools"'::jsonb, '"They are six Vedangas"'::jsonb, '"They are the four Vedas"'::jsonb, '"They are measurement units"'::jsonb, '"Describe the specific textile/dyeing process using credible evidence and distinguish it from a general course-level theme"'::jsonb, '"Assume all fabrics used one dyeing method"'::jsonb, '"Use a calendar to prove the dye chemistry"'::jsonb, '"Infer all details from the word ''speciality''"'::jsonb, '"Source-specific historical documentation linking the plan to the relevant planning principles"'::jsonb, '"An unrelated HTML layout"'::jsonb, '"A list of the four Vedas only"'::jsonb, '"A statement that all grids are Vastu-based"'::jsonb, '"Discuss the narrative''s cultural/ethical lessons separately from empirical engineering evidence"'::jsonb, '"Treat every narrative detail as a modern engineering specification"'::jsonb, '"Assume an epic is a computer manual"'::jsonb, '"Ignore context and use it as a measurement standard"'::jsonb, '"The course includes arithmetic, geometry, trigonometry and algebra in ancient texts"'::jsonb, '"Every formula used today was invented in one ancient text"'::jsonb, '"All modern computer science is derived from a single Veda"'::jsonb, '"A specific date is certain even though no evidence is supplied"'::jsonb, '"Analyse the specified environmental practice and settlement/forest-management context with evidence"'::jsonb, '"Classify the study as CSS animation"'::jsonb, '